OL,3,AAid worker in Nepal says hope remains
OL,4,Aof finding survivors as more than 500
OL,5,Akilled by flash floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll in Nepal has risen to
OL,8,F538, officials say, after Wednesday's
OL,9,Fflash flooding devastated the Himalayan
OL,10,Fborder region
OL,12,FAn aid worker tells the BBC the
OL,13,Fsituation in Nepal is "chaos", but he
OL,14,Fbelieves there is hope that those still
OL,15,Fmissing "could be found alive"
OL,17,FNepalese officials say more than 100
OL,18,Fforeign nationals have been rescued.
OL,19,FEarlier, they said more 500 were
OL,20,Fmissing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
